BGI is a startup accelerator, born in 2010 from a partnership between MIT Portugal (MIT Portugal Entrepreneurship and Innovation Initiative) and ISCTE.

Over the past decade, our flagship accelerator program, BGI Accelerator, has helped over 160 startups from 76 countries raise over €300 million. The accelerator is directed at aspiring entrepreneurs and innovators (startups under 5 years old), working on 4 market verticals:
1. Medical Devices & Health IT;
2. Smart cities & Industry 4.0 Solutions;
3. Enterprise IT & Smart Data;
4. Water Economy.

